  "body": "## What's Changed\n* test: record v0.2.22 public adopter acceptance by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/135\n* chore: close WI-178 adopter finalization by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/136\n* docs: close v0.2.22 adopter parity by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/137\n* chore: close WI-179 parity correction by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/138\n* docs: close stale parity status by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/139\n* chore: close WI-180 parity correction by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/140\n* docs: bind parity evidence references by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/141\n* fix: publish parallel leases atomically by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/142\n* chore: close WI-182 parallel lease fix by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/143\n* chore: close WI-181 parity evidence binding by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/144\n* release: prepare v0.2.23 baseline by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/145\n* chore: reconcile v0.2.23 release finalization by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/146\n* v0.2.23 parity收尾を記録 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/147\n* WI-185 parity收尾を完了 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/148\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/compare/v0.2.22...v0.2.23",
